#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059557 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2129aee3-923d-57de-8bdc-983ffdf787f1" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Determinant of a 2x2 Matrix With Integer Entries"}] :question/id #uuid "2b6e8845-a53d-510c-b44f-1b00271ee507" :question/math-academy-id "e-4434" :question/problem "Calculate $\\det(A),$ if <div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 6\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "For a $2 \\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix} = ad - bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & =\\begin{vmatrix}3 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 6\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =3\\cdot 6-2\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =18-10 \\\\  & =8\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059558 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "26e8a6ff-e5ed-59a7-b31d-1981495bf26a" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Determinant of a 2x2 Matrix With Non-Integer Entries"}] :question/id #uuid "b066b73a-c777-550c-9c6e-af8093bf7fab" :question/math-academy-id "e-4435" :question/problem "Calculate $\\det(A),$ if <div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{2} & -2 \\\\ 0 & \\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "For a $2 \\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix} = ad - bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & =\\begin{vmatrix}\\sqrt{2} & -2 \\\\ 0 & \\sqrt{3}\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}\\cdot \\sqrt{3}-(-2)\\cdot 0 \\\\  & =\\sqrt{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059559 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4ccdde46-a4ab-517e-910b-571a3a166b6a" :knowledge-point/title "Solving for an Unknown in an Expression Involving the Determinant of a 2x2 Matrix"}] :question/id #uuid "043a5e58-e1a0-50a5-b1be-d404e6262991" :question/math-academy-id "e-4436" :question/problem "If\n$$\n\\displaystyle {A} = \n    \\left\\lbrack\n    \\begin{matrix}\n        2 & -1  \\\\\n        -3 & k\n    \\end{matrix}\n    \\right\\rbrack\n$$\nand\n$\\det({A}) = 5$, what is the value of $k?$" :question/worked-solution "For a $2 \\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix} = ad - bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & =\\begin{vmatrix}2 & -1 \\\\ -3 & k\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =2\\cdot k-(-1)\\cdot (-3) \\\\  & =2k-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\det(A)=5,$ we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & =5 \\\\ 2k-3 & =5 \\\\ 2k & =8 \\\\ k & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059980 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2129aee3-923d-57de-8bdc-983ffdf787f1" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Determinant of a 2x2 Matrix With Integer Entries"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0bef9d71-e6eb-54e4-8e8e-a529aa8f1992" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186241284} {:answer/id #uuid "af58227c-7285-5719-b8ee-6e95dc121818" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242708} {:answer/id #uuid "b33e532a-b90d-5de2-812f-858d1ea4ce57" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242741} {:answer/id #uuid "b7782812-7471-5927-8799-42fa4e8f2c90" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242786} {:answer/id #uuid "d690db23-f51d-5c54-a3fe-07d2f24b9b75" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186243082}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0bef9d71-e6eb-54e4-8e8e-a529aa8f1992" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186241284} :answer-field/id #uuid "bbd1e424-be57-57db-8709-ae267fc7b54a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186243770}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "67459f8a-4276-51e0-8ff0-10c56a6d248e" :question/math-academy-id "q-1079" :question/problem "Calculate $\\text{det}(A)$, if\n$$\n\\displaystyle A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}(A) & =\\begin{vmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =1\\cdot 0-2\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =0-6 \\\\  & =-6\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059981 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "26e8a6ff-e5ed-59a7-b31d-1981495bf26a" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Determinant of a 2x2 Matrix With Non-Integer Entries"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b466bee3-4694-50ff-b4ff-be40469939a3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056245} {:answer/id #uuid "14252abb-f88d-5c80-a1a7-50e1c5101e76" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{6} + 5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056246} {:answer/id #uuid "422a8592-44c9-5cd7-a9f8-f218255dd350" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\sqrt{2} - 5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056247} {:answer/id #uuid "5403717f-fd25-5fdf-9147-cb1006233b46" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056248} {:answer/id #uuid "62819f9b-2032-516f-902f-f58dc1fc0aaf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{6} - 5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056249}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "422a8592-44c9-5cd7-a9f8-f218255dd350" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\sqrt{2} - 5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056247} :answer-field/id #uuid "49e48a24-3b9b-576a-ba9c-ed6114af8aa4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056244}] :question/id #uuid "50adc5c7-3aa8-5ed8-9f4a-a8650f063784" :question/math-academy-id "q-1088" :question/problem "What is $\\begin{vmatrix}\\sqrt{2} & 5 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{vmatrix}$?" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\begin{vmatrix}\\sqrt{2} & 5 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{vmatrix}\n&=\\sqrt{2}\\cdot3-5\\cdot1 \\\\\n&=3\\sqrt{2}-5.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059982 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "26e8a6ff-e5ed-59a7-b31d-1981495bf26a" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Determinant of a 2x2 Matrix With Non-Integer Entries"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "39c21266-f6c2-5bea-9e7b-5c12a6cd64b5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x-2{y}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186241696} {:answer/id #uuid "3e6a2a2e-5861-5f92-b070-b29670058f9e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\sqrt{x}-{y}^{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186241737} {:answer/id #uuid "404488cf-c12a-5d3e-8f12-bae9be5d6d67" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x-{y}^{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186241756} {:answer/id #uuid "95789385-1849-5307-a089-1a094f6dcc15" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{x}-2{y}^{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242493} {:answer/id #uuid "d8e15fa7-75e2-5444-be13-0b59e1863f69" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x-{y}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186243110}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "404488cf-c12a-5d3e-8f12-bae9be5d6d67" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x-{y}^{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186241756} :answer-field/id #uuid "2b79083a-ceaf-5ef9-8a92-8b480f0daf73" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186243517}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "31d5493d-598a-5cd3-9717-dec41584eaba" :question/math-academy-id "q-1089" :question/problem "Calculate $det(Z)$, if\n $$\n\\displaystyle Z=\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{x} & y \\\\ {y}^{2} & \\sqrt{x}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}(Z) & =\\begin{vmatrix}\\sqrt{x} & y \\\\ {y}^{2} & \\sqrt{x}\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{x}\\cdot \\sqrt{x}-y\\cdot {y}^{2} \\\\  & =x-{y}^{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060000 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2129aee3-923d-57de-8bdc-983ffdf787f1" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Determinant of a 2x2 Matrix With Integer Entries"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "adeef685-13ff-59be-8555-fa285a4b673e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056359} {:answer/id #uuid "e93e332c-0067-5a8e-978e-451498a19a05" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056360} {:answer/id #uuid "09a86a42-c0b8-57e0-a93a-e191a7d6b5f7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056361} {:answer/id #uuid "0a801cc5-5312-593f-9422-e650a8b22f74" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056362} {:answer/id #uuid "3f33f5eb-9069-5dcd-955b-ccc0b698801b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056363}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "adeef685-13ff-59be-8555-fa285a4b673e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056359} :answer-field/id #uuid "809ecc7b-96f9-5877-beda-07f945eee167" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056358}] :question/id #uuid "ea87b1ac-4625-5a01-8d70-68a1975a00a3" :question/math-academy-id "q-11648" :question/problem "What is $\\begin{vmatrix}2 & -4 \\\\ -2 & 7\\end{vmatrix}$?" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\begin{vmatrix}2 & -4 \\\\ -2 & 7\\end{vmatrix}\n&=2\\cdot7-(-4)\\cdot(-2) \\\\\n&=14-8 \\\\\n&=6.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060001 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4ccdde46-a4ab-517e-910b-571a3a166b6a" :knowledge-point/title "Solving for an Unknown in an Expression Involving the Determinant of a 2x2 Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a0ff914a-1317-5490-ba59-b2437dd6665a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "k = 9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056365} {:answer/id #uuid "be028415-acff-5d6d-8080-1a4b0687fc37" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "k =-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056366} {:answer/id #uuid "28d6cf2e-8b16-58ce-af42-d46cb399a7f6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "k =-9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056367} {:answer/id #uuid "3882486c-1efa-5685-9f10-e83963bf1488" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "k = 4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056368} {:answer/id #uuid "585ec4a5-edb5-5cf4-907c-653192911ffa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "k = 0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056369}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a0ff914a-1317-5490-ba59-b2437dd6665a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "k = 9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056365} :answer-field/id #uuid "463bd4e4-2bee-5ee4-b6dd-f8a4f765f86b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056364}] :question/id #uuid "cda11aab-d0f1-5aed-9faf-9b4214024dc7" :question/math-academy-id "q-11651" :question/problem "If\n$$\n\\displaystyle C = \\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ 5 & k\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand\n$det(C) = 3$, what is the value of $k$?" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\det(C)&=\\begin{vmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ 5 & k\\end{vmatrix} \\\\\n&=2\\cdot k-3\\cdot5 \\\\\n&=2k-15.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\det(C)=3$, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n2k-15&=3 \\\\\n2k&=18 \\\\\nk&=9.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060195 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4ccdde46-a4ab-517e-910b-571a3a166b6a" :knowledge-point/title "Solving for an Unknown in an Expression Involving the Determinant of a 2x2 Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a8f75c6a-39ca-54ce-90b2-d2fed57bce1c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057631} {:answer/id #uuid "f1cc6fa4-5d2d-5ef7-8b9e-ca6b2a04a6df" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057632} {:answer/id #uuid "34efec5a-0267-59a9-a0e8-a8bbc8e3bbc3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057633} {:answer/id #uuid "626288b8-1266-5c66-8802-e4279b82a65f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057634} {:answer/id #uuid "65626e08-ea8e-5f2e-a56f-1de07c241265" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057635}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "34efec5a-0267-59a9-a0e8-a8bbc8e3bbc3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057633} :answer-field/id #uuid "1cb55465-244d-5741-a788-539ef4e5adf4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057630}] :question/id #uuid "e1d88843-5476-50c9-8034-3251a4933b8a" :question/math-academy-id "q-19801" :question/problem "If\n$$\n\\displaystyle A = \\begin{bmatrix}1 + t & 2t \\\\ -3 & 1 - t\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand $det(A) = 10$, what is the value of $t$?" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\det(A)&=\\begin{vmatrix}1+t & 2t \\\\ -3 & 1-t\\end{vmatrix} \\\\\n&=(1+t)(1-t)-(2t)(-3) \\\\\n&=1-t^2+6t.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\det(A)=10$, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n1-t^2+6t&=10 \\\\\nt^2-6t+9&=0 \\\\\n(t-3)^2&=0 \\\\\nt&=3.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186233379 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4ccdde46-a4ab-517e-910b-571a3a166b6a" :knowledge-point/title "Solving for an Unknown in an Expression Involving the Determinant of a 2x2 Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2d273204-9c71-5dd0-b69b-1a90276ae151" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186716952}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2d273204-9c71-5dd0-b69b-1a90276ae151" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186716952} :answer-field/id #uuid "d37edfe3-8d04-5659-9550-117d4c4acd83" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186716953}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "ed3ae951-db6d-557c-8a34-9c013751cf9a" :question/math-academy-id "q-127614" :question/problem "If\n$$\n\\displaystyle D=\\begin{bmatrix}2x & 6 \\\\ 2x & x-2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand $det(D)=-32$, what is the value of $x?$\n\n$x=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(D) & =\\begin{vmatrix}2x & 6 \\\\ 2x & x-2\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =2x\\cdot (x-2)-6\\cdot 2x \\\\  & =2{x}^{2}-16x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $det(D)=-32$, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(D) & =-32 \\\\ 2{x}^{2}-16x & =-32 \\\\ 2{x}^{2}-16x+32 & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}-8x+16 & =0 \\\\ (x-4)^{2} & =0 \\\\ x & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186244112 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2129aee3-923d-57de-8bdc-983ffdf787f1" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Determinant of a 2x2 Matrix With Integer Entries"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "089d503b-4f24-5763-9960-5ba89a429460" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186241256} {:answer/id #uuid "1e118c0a-4e95-58e5-a976-91027b338e8e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-34" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186241438} {:answer/id #uuid "7326fac1-3a0a-542f-ada6-d08f1f8e9903" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "43" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242201} {:answer/id #uuid "8d44a50b-e600-5db0-a6a5-f5e4f444fa6d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "17" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242426} {:answer/id #uuid "b626af1e-b5fa-55ea-8216-0d91300e2897" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "37" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242774}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7326fac1-3a0a-542f-ada6-d08f1f8e9903" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "43" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242201} :answer-field/id #uuid "451243fc-f02f-57e6-b84d-3ae575f2644f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186243569}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "63888dba-48b5-5525-9ea0-6080e9970645" :question/math-academy-id "q-1080" :question/problem "Calculate $\\text{det}(X)$, if\n$$\n\\displaystyle X=\\begin{bmatrix}10 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}(X) & =\\begin{vmatrix}10 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =10\\cdot 4-(-3)\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =40-(-3) \\\\  & =43\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186244117 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "26e8a6ff-e5ed-59a7-b31d-1981495bf26a" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Determinant of a 2x2 Matrix With Non-Integer Entries"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "098d3c16-b771-5cb2-8ca3-8e05e6e12a5c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186241263} {:answer/id #uuid "409c02b9-d9b4-55b4-bf81-e98091b0492b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186241757} {:answer/id #uuid "53b66e4c-123c-5d65-a013-eb5273d4b910" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6x-{y}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186241929} {:answer/id #uuid "62f7f512-fffc-58a3-bb47-dd0d46209f22" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6x-{y}^{2}z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242069} {:answer/id #uuid "637034ca-7cd9-52c8-ad26-49ffc9798d80" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6x-{y}^{2}z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242077}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "637034ca-7cd9-52c8-ad26-49ffc9798d80" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6x-{y}^{2}z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242077} :answer-field/id #uuid "0b2eb4c8-aa05-5d06-93d8-a00bf06218cb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186243459}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "04f24cee-9b4e-520b-8022-59737dad510a" :question/math-academy-id "q-1083" :question/problem "$$\n\\displaystyle \\begin{vmatrix}2x & {y}^{2} \\\\ z & -3\\end{vmatrix}=\n$$" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{vmatrix}2x & {y}^{2} \\\\ z & -3\\end{vmatrix} & =2x\\cdot (-3)-{y}^{2}\\cdot z \\\\  & =-6x-{y}^{2}z\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186244154 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "26e8a6ff-e5ed-59a7-b31d-1981495bf26a" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Determinant of a 2x2 Matrix With Non-Integer Entries"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "03b3c5a5-7375-5461-b9f0-c802ef651773" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186241212} {:answer/id #uuid "2f76bb9d-e6c7-5e1a-b8a2-67876cf68b7e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186241604} {:answer/id #uuid "78aac119-4dde-5951-ad35-559a566ff943" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-17" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242243} {:answer/id #uuid "a223bb82-bec3-501b-aded-253a53009b2f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242600} {:answer/id #uuid "c3968252-fc1a-5b53-9617-261d78f533e2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "22" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242897}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a223bb82-bec3-501b-aded-253a53009b2f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242600} :answer-field/id #uuid "cf01c73d-57cf-5598-8656-0c2a923068f4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186243800}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "2c5d0d5a-1c35-5e42-acae-01a474314ae5" :question/math-academy-id "q-1087" :question/problem "Calculate $det(T)$, if\n$$\n\\displaystyle T=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{2} & 17 \\\\ 1 & 10\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}(T) & =\\begin{vmatrix}\\frac{1}{2} & 17 \\\\ 1 & 10\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 10-17\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =5-17 \\\\  & =-12\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186253262 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2129aee3-923d-57de-8bdc-983ffdf787f1" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Determinant of a 2x2 Matrix With Integer Entries"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "08b409ba-367b-57b5-9cc8-a4cc43e79abb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186250629} {:answer/id #uuid "111ce74d-7bba-5493-aa71-8ee83c614b3b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-22" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186250701} {:answer/id #uuid "47fa1918-9d0b-56af-8644-cc0f2fc9b075" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186251150} {:answer/id #uuid "59b9af1c-53b9-5140-bb46-d0e5ad2ee18e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "22" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186251290} {:answer/id #uuid "ee44218a-1840-5afa-8d45-0c6d89d6e523" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186252638}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "59b9af1c-53b9-5140-bb46-d0e